    {
      "source": "A resolved <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> is post-processed by applying Jackson field-to-property mapping. Customized fields are\nresolved to their property names. Unknown properties are removed from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>.",
      "translation": "已解析的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Sort</code></a> 会通过应用 Jackson 字段到属性的映射进行后处理。自定义字段会被解析为其属性名称，未知的属性将从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Sort</code></a> 中移除。",
